Volume I and shall not leave his post until he is duly relieved. While on guard duty, the Fireman shall -
(a)
guard all properties, fixtures, fittings and other effects both in the fire station premises and station surroundings;
(b)
see that all persons entering the fire station premises are directed to the officer in charge;
(c)
be aware and remain alert at all times;
(d)
control the movement of incoming and out-going vehicles to avoid accident;
(e)
