patrol round the entire premises and surroundings once in every fifteen minutes while on duty;
(f)
in the case of workshop search all persons leaving the workshop. He shall prevent any authorised article being brought
into, or removed from, the workshop;
(g)
shall report to the persons in charge of the telephone in the workshop the movement of all officers and appliances
arriving at and leaving the workshop.
